┌ Help ─ main view ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Everything flk runs on this host. Left: apps, with their machines (●         │
│ running, ○ stopped, ! should run but doesn't), volumes (▢) and forwarded     │
│ ports (⇄), then the host. Right: tabs for the selection. Bottom: what needs  │
│ attention, from flk context --all. Each tab shows the flk command that fills │
│ it.                                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│ ↑ ↓  k j           move in the tree                                          │
│ ← →                fold or unfold an app                                     │
│ tab  shift+tab     next or previous tab                                      │
│ 1 … 9              jump to a tab                                             │
│ pgup pgdn          scroll the tab (also ctrl+u ctrl+d)                       │
│ l                  follow logs: the machine, or all of the app's machines    │
│ ?                  this help                                                 │
│ q  ctrl+c          quit                                                      │
│                                                                              │
